WEBVTT

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.500
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.500
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.670
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.670
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:50.580
BARAN'S RAGE

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:51.880
Popp!

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:57.970
Drop your weapon!
Otherwise, I crush the boy's skull!

00:01:57.970 --> 00:01:59.300
You dirty...!

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:05.150
Better hurry up!

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:12.400
If I do, no, if you kill me,
will you really let him go?

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:17.200
I have no interest in this insect's life!

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:21.120
All I want is your head!

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:24.790
What will it be?!

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:27.660
Very well.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:29.500
Wait!

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:33.490
Don't, Hyunckel! Forget about me!

00:02:33.490 --> 00:02:35.050
Shut up!

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:38.550
Just kill him!

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:40.260
I can't do that.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.100
You idiot!

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:49.230
Between me, who's out of Magic Power
and you, it's obvious who can help Dai!

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:50.900
Popp!

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:56.690
Besides, there's someone
who'll be miserable if you die!

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.410
<i>Maam...</i>

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:03.660
Her tears are the last thing
I ever want to see!

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:06.330
So please, you have to live!

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:11.820
And go on and make her happy.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:17.180
I can't make people happy.
All I bring is misfortune.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:18.380
That's why...

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:22.810
I wanted to bring misfortune
to evil-doers.

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:27.100
That's the only reason
I decided to join your party.

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:34.270
Besides, I'd rather not give Avan another
reason to scold me in the afterlife.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:41.200
If he hears I abandoned a junior disciple,
he'll reject me for sure.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:42.910
Hyunckel...

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:49.870
That's the attitude! Don't move!

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:53.170
Don't! Please don't!

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.260
Die!

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:00.920
Hyunckel!

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.150
Larhart!

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.870
Why did you save me?

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:32.670
To use a hostage would bring shame
to the Dragon Masters.

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:34.960
It was unforgivable.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.300
And against a human no less.

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:41.090
Why do you hate humans so much?

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:47.730
Like Master Dino, I was born
between beings of different races.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:51.430
In my case, it was a Darkling and a human.

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:57.860
My Darkling father died early,
and I was raised by my human mother.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:01.070
But, when I was seven,

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:05.700
war between Dark Lord Hadlar
and the humans began.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:15.210
<i>Just because of my Darkling lineage,
the humans discriminated against me.</i>

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:20.040
<i>Not just against me,
but against my mother as well!</i>

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:32.930
<i>Eventually, my mother fell ill
and died a forsaken death.</i>

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:50.490
<i>Master Baran was the only one
who ever understood my pain.</i>

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:05.760
You soft fools.
To feel my pain as your own.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:10.640
I've never met humans like you.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:16.270
Perhaps you will be able to understand
Master Baran's pain.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:20.900
I leave Master Baran
and Master Dino in your hands.

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.240
Larhart...

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:26.820
Hyunckel, I have one more request.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:28.200
Name it.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:34.200
Will you accept my Dark Armour Spear?

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.870
I want you to use it.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:17.580
It seems the armour favors you as well.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.620
It may have been in battle...

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:25.960
but I'm glad I met men like you...

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:29.380
at the very end.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:44.440
<i>Larhart, I accept
your will and this armour...</i>

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:47.780
<i>that contains your soul.</i>

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.200
It feels like we're doomed.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.370
Do you have a plan, Crocodine?

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.830
I was hoping you had one.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:05.250
If only Hyunckel was here.
Then we may have had options.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.630
He's here!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.690
Hand over Dino.

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:21.810
No!

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:26.280
Do you think you two can stop me alone?

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:29.480
Or do you have some sort of plan?

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:36.450
<i>Of course not.
There's no way for us to stop Baran.</i>

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:41.700
<i>If only... If only we had one more ally!</i>

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:45.080
Speaking of plans...

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:50.180
that Mage came to stop us
on the way here.

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:53.510
I left him to the Dragon Masters
and came ahead.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:54.680
He means...

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:55.680
Popp?!

00:08:56.050 --> 00:09:02.390
To sacrifice such a whelp
was unusually cruel of you, Crocodine.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:07.190
Or was it the idea of the girl beside you?

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.360
Popp... How could he...?

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:14.240
Popp, you went
to stop Baran's forces alone?

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:17.320
That's why you pretended to abandon us?!

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:21.660
You chose to be hated. All for Dai!

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:27.420
I can't believe I actually hit him.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:40.060
<i>I've been such a fool!</i>

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:45.350
<i>I couldn't realize how determined you were
and called you a coward!</i>

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.940
<i>Forgive me, Popp!</i>

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:51.230
<i>You can hit me all you like
in the afterlife!</i>

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:53.570
Have you lost your mind, Crocodine?

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:55.860
My eyes have been opened!

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:00.370
Baran, fight me!

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:03.580
It seems you truly have lost your mind.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:08.120
Princess, I have a plan. I need your help.

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.670
It's too dangerous, Crocodine!

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.220
I'm counting on you!

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:31.900
Draconic Aura!

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:45.910
<i>Unbelievable! He blocked an attack
imbued with my Draconic Aura!</i>

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:49.920
Baran, use your Gigabreak!

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:50.960
What?!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:53.720
My tough hide is my only strength!

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:58.590
Only your strongest attack
can take my life!

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.180
Well said!

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.980
I shall grant your wish!

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.570
Take this! My Ultimate Blade!

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:23.410
Crocodine seems to be
proving quite stubborn.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:27.910
<i>Hopefully Baran will be defeated here.</i>

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:32.170
<i>But I doubt he'll go down easily.</i>

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:41.090
Gigabreak!

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.900
Thus ends the Beast King.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:05.870
What?!

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:10.250
Thank you, Princess!
Now I can fight again!

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:16.170
But my Fullheal can't heal
both your wound and stamina at once.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.800
There should be no stamina to heal!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:23.850
Not even the Beast King can survive
a direct hit with my Gigabreak!

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:28.350
All I need to do is focus
all my power on defense!

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:34.480
So long as I'm not a corpse, the Princess
can heal my stamina with her Fullheal!

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.240
Hit me as much as you like!

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:42.530
My life or your power!
It's a contest to see which ends first!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.530
A contest?!

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:52.040
You dare mock me...
mock the power of the Dragon Knight?!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:58.750
I think you hurt his pride
by not dying with one blow!

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:01.340
What an overwhelming Aura!

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:04.260
Crocodine, this is crazy!

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:08.270
You don't know
how long you'll last fighting like this!

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:10.560
I'm well aware that this is crazy!

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:15.350
But it's the only way to stop Baran!
I have no choice!

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:19.900
Let us follow Popp's spirit, Princess!

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:23.860
You're right.
I guess it's punishment for hitting him!

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.290
What's wrong, Dai?!

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:38.210
I feel like I'm burning!
I can't sit still!

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:45.470
I have to go.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:52.930
Someone is calling me.

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.600
BLOODY SCRYDE

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.610
BEAST KING REDEMPTION BLAST

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.070
Crocodine!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.750
Are you immortal?!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:21.500
No one has ever been hit by
my Gigabreak twice and survived!

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:26.010
Immortality is Hyunckel's thing.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:31.510
If I keep getting hit
by such an attack, I'm certain I'll die.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:37.900
But if taking my life
drains your power, it's not a bad trade.

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:41.940
You...! You're not trying to win at all!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:48.700
You're using your own life
to drain my stamina and Magic Power!

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:57.620
Impossible! The mighty Beast King
Crocodine would sacrifice himself?!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.750
This is the best I can do.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:07.090
If I can drain your power, it'll help
my friends who will fight you later.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:10.220
Your friends?! No one is coming!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.680
They'll come!

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:13.550
I know it!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:17.310
<i>How can he trust the humans so much?!</i>

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:20.770
<i>And that spirit is making him stronger!</i>

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:26.150
<i>Even with the full power of my Crest,
I can't crush him like before!</i>

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.610
<i>He need a Fullheal!</i>

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.250
A Zapple spell?!

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.040
That was a warning!

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:38.830
Take another step
and become a charred corpse!

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:43.830
I'm done with this game of cat and mouse!

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:47.050
This time, I will end it!

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:01.520
No! Stop!

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:02.440
No!

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:04.650
Fool! Zapple!

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:10.030
Princess!

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.160
What?!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.160
Larhart's Dark Spear?

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:24.420
Why would he interfere?!

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.590
What's the meaning of this Lar--

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:33.970
Hyunckel?!

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:35.270
And Popp!

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:37.850
You survived, Popp!

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:41.060
Just barely.

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:46.150
But we managed to take out
the Dragon Masters.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.990
Impossible! You speak lies!

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:50.610
It's not a lie.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:55.450
How else can you explain our presence?

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:57.910
I see.

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:02.920
So you killed Larhart and took his armour.

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:08.630
No. Larhart gave me this armour
of his own free will.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:09.680
What?!

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:14.220
He died asking me to save you.

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:18.310
He gave me this armour then.

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:20.560
It was his dying gift.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:26.190
Liar! Larhart would never
open up to a human!

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:30.360
Baran, Larhart told me of your tragedy.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:35.240
How Dai's mother, Soala,
was the princess of Alkeed.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:41.660
And how it was the humans
who took her life.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:46.500
I understand your anger
and grief all too well.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.670
But not all humans are evil!

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:53.840
You yourself know that
more than anyone!

00:17:54.210 --> 00:18:00.390
For the woman that you loved
was also a human!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:09.280
You saw the most beautiful and most ugly
sides of humans at the same time.

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:16.400
Unable to handle it, you hoped to erase
all of humanity from your sight.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.910
But you're mistaken.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:24.870
Doing that won't erase
your grief from losing her!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:31.470
If you truly call yourself Dai's father...
If you truly love your son...

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:36.170
then shouldn't you reach out to him
with your human heart, Baran?!

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:40.020
I know that's what Dai's mother
would want!

00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:42.690
Baran, Hyunckel's right.

00:18:42.690 --> 00:18:44.100
Baran...

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:58.110
<i>What is this unnatural pressure
coming from Baran?</i>

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.570
Then I cast it aside!

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:05.160
This human heart and body!

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:13.210
None of your pandering nonsense
will bring back Soala!

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:19.890
To destroy the humans together with Dino
is all that drives me now!

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:22.520
It's all I live for!

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:27.810
If I cannot have that,
then I would rather die!

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:32.350
Something weird is going on with him!

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:38.110
<i>I will reclaim Dino by force if I must!</i>

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:42.610
<i>Even if I must become
a Demon Beast to do it!</i>

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:45.530
Impossible! Look!

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:50.920
His red blood is turning into
Blue Blood of Darklings!

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:52.000
What?!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:52.710
That's...!

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:05.060
What happened?!

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:10.310
<i>Report. Heyedras stationed
in Teran are disappearing.</i>

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:14.030
<i>Extraordinary energy
is spreading explosively.</i>

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:16.860
Impossible! How can that be?!

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:23.660
I'd heard of it, but it seems Baran
is taking his ultimate form.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:28.670
Send all Heyedras in the area
to Teran Castle!

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:30.000
Yes, master.

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:45.180
What's happening to him?!

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:46.680
Baran's body...

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.350
...Is changing!

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:43.940
Is this the true form of a Dragon Knight?!

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:46.490
Indeed.

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:49.500
The combined power of Dragon,
Darkling, and human.

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:52.920
The Ultimate Combat Form
of the Dragon Knight.

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:54.830
That is this form.

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:59.750
The form known as the Dragonoid!

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:11.350
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:11.350
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:15.430
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:15.430
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:19.480
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:19.480
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.780
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.780
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:26.700
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:26.700
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:30.410
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:30.410
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:34.700
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:34.700
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:38.750
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:38.750
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.540
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.540
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:48.130
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:48.130
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:22:59.810
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:22:59.810
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:03.980
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:03.980
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:08.490
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:08.490
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:11.660
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:11.660
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:22.540
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:22.540
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:37.520
<i>Baran's power as a Dragonoid
is beyond this world.</i>

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:42.900
<i>Even Hyunckel and Crocodine together
prove to be no match.</i>

00:23:43.060 --> 00:23:46.690
<i>At last, Baran finds Dai,
who lost his memories.</i>

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:52.660
<i>Just when all seems lost,
Popp thinks of one last plan.</i>

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:55.410
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.580 --> 00:23:57.080
<i>"Popp's Resolve"</i>

00:23:57.240 --> 00:23:59.370
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
